### ====================================
### Early Warning Agent - Test Requests
### ====================================
### Use the "Send Request" link above each request to execute

### ------------------------------------------
### 1. Trigger Delay Alert - HIGH Priority (10 days)
### ------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/triggerDelayAlert
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "supplier": "Acme Corp",
    "material": "Steel Rods A-500",
    "delayedDays": 10,
    "po": "PO-2024-001",
    "plant": "Plant-Munich"
}

### ------------------------------------------
### 2. Trigger Delay Alert - CRITICAL Priority (20 days)
### ------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/triggerDelayAlert
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "supplier": "Global Electronics Ltd",
    "material": "Semiconductor Chip XC-7000",
    "delayedDays": 22,
    "po": "PO-2024-URGENT",
    "plant": "Plant-Shanghai"
}

### ------------------------------------------
### 3. Trigger Delay Alert - MEDIUM Priority (5 days)
### ------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/triggerDelayAlert
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "supplier": "Parts Unlimited",
    "material": "Aluminum Housing B-200",
    "delayedDays": 5,
    "po": "PO-2024-003",
    "plant": "Plant-Berlin"
}

### ------------------------------------------
### 4. Trigger Delay Alert - LOW Priority (2 days)
### ------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/triggerDelayAlert
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "supplier": "Quick Supply Co",
    "material": "Packaging Material P-100",
    "delayedDays": 2,
    "po": "PO-2024-004",
    "plant": "Plant-London"
}

### ------------------------------------------
### 5. Get All Cases (verify alerts were created)
### ------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/Cases

### ------------------------------------------
### 6. Get Cases with filter - Open status only
### ------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/Cases?$filter=status eq 'Open'

### ------------------------------------------
### 7. Get Cases with filter - Critical priority only
### ------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/Cases?$filter=priority eq 'Critical'

### ------------------------------------------
### 8. Get Cases with filter - Delivery Delay events
### ------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplier-resilience/Cases?$filter=eventType eq 'Delivery Delay'


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### Supplier Resilience Service - API Test Suite
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### This file tests all the migrated agent functionality from Python to CAP/Node.js
### Run with REST Client extension in VS Code / BAS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/supplierresilience

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### HEALTH & CONFIGURATION
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check
# Equivalent to: GET /api/v1/health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health()
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/getConfig()
Content-Type: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### MASTER DATA ENTITIES (OData)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get All Suppliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/Suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Single Supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/Suppliers('SUP001')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Materials
GET {{baseUrl}}/Materials
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Single Material (for Early Warning tests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Materials('AL_SHEET_001')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/Inventory
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Inventory for Specific Material and Plant
GET {{baseUrl}}/Inventory?$filter=materialId eq 'AL_SHEET_001' and plant eq 'MUMBAI'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Demands
GET {{baseUrl}}/Demands
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Demand for Specific Material
GET {{baseUrl}}/Demands?$filter=materialId eq 'AL_SHEET_001'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Purchase Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/PurchaseOrders
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Delayed Purchase Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/PurchaseOrders?$filter=status eq 'DELAYED'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Disruption Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/DisruptionEvents
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/Cases
Content-Type: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AGENT ACTIONS - EARLY WARNING
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Run Early Warning Agent
# Tests deterministic risk scoring
# Expected: Same input always produces same risk score
POST {{baseUrl}}/runEarlyWarning
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-EW-001",
    "supplier": "SUP001",
    "material": "AL_SHEET_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "delayDays": 14
}

###

### Run Early Warning - Different Supplier (High OTIF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/runEarlyWarning
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-EW-002",
    "supplier": "SUP003",
    "material": "PET_PREFORM_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "delayDays": 5
}

###

### Assess Supplier (Quick Assessment)
# Equivalent to: GET /api/v1/suppliers/{id}/assess
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessSupplier(supplierId='SUP001',delayDays=14)
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Assess High-Performing Supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessSupplier(supplierId='SUP003',delayDays=0)
Content-Type: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AGENT ACTIONS - SURVIVAL
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Run Survival Agent
# Tests inventory survival calculation
# Expected: Deterministic survival weeks based on inventory/demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/runSurvival
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-SURV-001",
    "material": "AL_SHEET_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "supplierRecoveryWeeks": 4
}

###

### Run Survival - Different Material
POST {{baseUrl}}/runSurvival
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-SURV-002",
    "material": "PET_PREFORM_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "supplierRecoveryWeeks": 3
}

###

### Run Survival - High Recovery Time (Expect Shortfall)
POST {{baseUrl}}/runSurvival
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-SURV-003",
    "material": "AL_SHEET_001",
    "plant": "PUNE",
    "supplierRecoveryWeeks": 8
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AGENT ACTIONS - COORDINATOR (Full Workflow)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Run Coordinator - Full Event Processing
# This is the main workflow that:
# 1. Validates the event
# 2. Creates a disruption case
# 3. Calls Early Warning Agent
# 4. Calls Survival Agent
# 5. Consolidates results with recommendation
POST {{baseUrl}}/runCoordinator
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId": "EVT-TEST-001",
    "eventType": "DELIVERY_DELAY",
    "eventTime": "2025-05-20T10:30:00Z",
    "po": "PO-2025-001",
    "supplier": "SUP001",
    "material": "AL_SHEET_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "delayDays": 14
}

###

### Run Coordinator - Critical Delay (21+ days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/runCoordinator
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId": "EVT-TEST-002",
    "eventType": "DELIVERY_DELAY",
    "eventTime": "2025-05-23T09:45:00Z",
    "po": "PO-2025-004",
    "supplier": "SUP001",
    "material": "AL_SHEET_001",
    "plant": "PUNE",
    "delayDays": 21
}

###

### Run Coordinator - Low-Risk Supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/runCoordinator
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId": "EVT-TEST-003",
    "eventType": "DELIVERY_DELAY",
    "eventTime": "2025-05-21T08:15:00Z",
    "po": "PO-2025-002",
    "supplier": "SUP003",
    "material": "PET_PREFORM_001",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "delayDays": 5
}

###

### Run Coordinator - Invalid Event (Missing Required Fields)
# Should return validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/runCoordinator
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId": "EVT-INVALID",
    "eventType": "UNKNOWN_TYPE",
    "po": "PO-2025-001"
}

