### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### RESULT ENTITIES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get Early Warning Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/EarlyWarningResults
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Survival Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/SurvivalResults
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Cases with High Priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/Cases?$filter=priority eq 'Critical' or priority eq 'High'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Cases Requiring Action
GET {{baseUrl}}/Cases?$filter=status eq 'ACTION_REQUIRED'
Content-Type: application/json

